Package: goddns
Version: 2026.06.11-1
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: systemd, ca-certificates
Maintainer: Christos Panagiotakis <chris@nixpal.com>
Description: Self-hosted Dynamic DNS over RFC 2136 / TSIG
 goddns runs an HTTPS endpoint that maps bearer tokens to single DNS
 records and pushes signed RFC 2136 dynamic updates to BIND. Includes a
 DynDNS2-compatible endpoint for off-the-shelf router clients and
 optional self-issued TLS via ACME DNS-01 (no port 80/443 needed).
